{"id": "S0001", "offset": 0, "section": "abstract", "text": "摘要"}
{"id": "S0002", "offset": 3, "section": "abstract", "text": "本文研究纳米涂层对钛合金疲劳寿命的影响。"}
{"id": "S0003", "offset": 23, "section": "abstract", "text": "我们提出一种梯度涂层工艺。"}
{"id": "S0004", "offset": 36, "section": "abstract", "text": "实验表明该工艺使疲劳寿命显著提高 40%。"}
{"id": "S0005", "offset": 57, "section": "abstract", "text": "Smith et al. (2021) reported that 涂层界面结合力是关键限制因素。"}
{"id": "S0006", "offset": 106, "section": "abstract", "text": "本研究为航空构件延寿提供了新途径。"}
{"id": "S0007", "offset": 125, "section": "introduction", "text": "引言"}
{"id": "S0008", "offset": 128, "section": "introduction", "text": "钛合金构件的疲劳失效是航空安全的核心问题。"}
{"id": "S0009", "offset": 149, "section": "introduction", "text": "已有研究表明表面改性是有效手段 [2]。"}
{"id": "S0010", "offset": 169, "section": "introduction", "text": "本文将分析梯度涂层的工艺窗口，并回答涂层厚度与寿命增益的定量关系。"}
{"id": "S0011", "offset": 204, "section": "methods", "text": "方法"}
{"id": "S0012", "offset": 207, "section": "methods", "text": "采用磁控溅射制备梯度涂层，厚度 2 至 8 微米。"}
{"id": "S0013", "offset": 232, "section": "methods", "text": "每组 5 个试样，旋转弯曲疲劳测试。"}
{"id": "S0014", "offset": 250, "section": "methods", "text": "设置未涂层试样作为对照组，用于排除基体批次差异。"}
{"id": "S0015", "offset": 276, "section": "results", "text": "结果"}
{"id": "S0016", "offset": 279, "section": "results", "text": "涂层试样的中位疲劳寿命为 1.4e5 周次，对照组为 1.0e5 周次。"}
{"id": "S0017", "offset": 315, "section": "results", "text": "厚度 4 微米时增益最大。"}
{"id": "S0018", "offset": 330, "section": "discussion", "text": "讨论"}
{"id": "S0019", "offset": 333, "section": "discussion", "text": "我们认为界面结合力主导了寿命增益。"}
{"id": "S0020", "offset": 350, "section": "discussion", "text": "假如涂层不发生早期剥落，增益有望进一步提高。"}
{"id": "S0021", "offset": 372, "section": "discussion", "text": "这一假设情形有待后续实验验证。"}
{"id": "S0022", "offset": 389, "section": "references", "text": "参考文献"}
{"id": "S0023", "offset": 394, "section": "references", "text": "[2] 李 et al., 表面改性综述, 2020."}
